From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Wooseong Kim <innocarpe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 9 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0900
Subject: [PATCH 12/12] fix(vendor): satisfy strict clippy baseline

Use portable dunce canonicalization in pager tests and test helpers,
rewrite boolean comparisons as boolean assertions, collapse an identical
feature-gated expected value, and make the fast-worktree GC sleeper a
guarded test fixture so it is killed and waited even if the test panics.

---
